      "message": "Thanks for the explanation Alyssa. IIUC, the two options under consideration are\n1. b/346995836#comment7: Add framework-pdf to combined_apis in U-. This will require CPs to older branches\n2. b/346995836#comment10: Remove framework-pdf\u0027s apis from modular hiddenapi files. This has the advantage that we do not need to do CPs.\n\nDo apps/tests etc in U- platform trees need access to framework-pdf\u0027s apis at compile time? I believe in option 2, setting an sdk_version to *_current will not add framework-pdf\u0027s apis to the classpath, and will require explicitly adding this library to `libs` property.\n\n(Btw, if we were to go with option #1, can we use a soong config variable to add framework-pdf to combined_apis only when prebuilts are active?)",
